<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>netstandard2.1</TargetFramework>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);1591</NoWarn>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>Mythosia.AI.Serving.Vllm</PackageId>
    <IsPackable>true</IsPackable>
    <Company>Mythosia</Company>
    <Authors>JJW</Authors>
    <PackageTags>AI; vLLM; LLM; Serving; Inference Server; Control Plane; Management; Model Card; Metrics; Prometheus; Health; Version;</PackageTags>
    <Description>
Control-plane (management/introspection) client for a running vLLM server: model cards (served aliases, the actually loaded model via the root field, max context length, LoRA adapters), health probe, server version, and Prometheus metrics.

Family taxonomy: Mythosia.AI.Providers.* = chat data plane (concrete AI services); Mythosia.AI.Serving.* = model-server control plane. Chat/completions against vLLM stay on Mythosia.AI (e.g. QwenService with EndpointPlatform.Vllm) — this package does not chat and does not host a server.

Documentation
- GitHub: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI
- Release Notes: src/serving/Mythosia.AI.Serving.Vllm/RELEASE_NOTES.md
    </Description>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/tree/main/src/serving/Mythosia.AI.Serving.Vllm</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>v1.0.0-preview: Initial preview — VllmServer control-plane client: GetModelsAsync/GetModelAsync (model cards incl. the stable-but-undocumented root/parent/max_model_len fields, DisplayModel fallback, LoRA detection), GetVersionAsync, IsHealthyAsync/GetHealthAsync (Healthy/EngineDead/Unauthorized/Unreachable/Unexpected), GetMetricsAsync (label-preserving Prometheus families + typed convenience getters), VllmException with OpenAI-style error-body parsing. Depends only on Newtonsoft.Json.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <Version>1.0.0-preview</Version>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Mythosia.AI.Serving.Vllm.Tests" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Newtonsoft.Json" Version="13.0.4" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Update="README.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
    <None Update="RELEASE_NOTES.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
